                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*  PROGRAM    :  W1164300                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  MATCH W11641 AND W01184 AND W01160 TO GET STOCK       *        
*                BALACE OF A SUPERSEEDED PART IN EU                    *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  ARUP DATTA                                            *        
*                                                                      *        
*  DATUM      :  FEBRUARY 2024                                         *        
*                                                                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*        FILE SECTION                  *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11643D1                                                                   
%W11641    (W11641-)                                                            
*                                                                               
FILE W11643D2                                                                   
%W01160                                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE W11643D3                                                                   
%W01184                                                                         
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  UTFIL                               *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11643D4 FB (26 0)                                                         
%W11641A   (W11641A-)                                                           
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  DC GROUPS                           *                                        
*--------------------------------------*                                        
%WWDC99                                                                         
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  WORKING STORAGE                     *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
                                                                                
WS-STOCK-BALANCE W  4 P 0                                                       
WS-KVAKS-CDC     W  4 P                                                         
WS-KVAKS-SDC     W  4 P                                                         
FL-CDC           W  1 A                                                         
JA               W  1 A    VALUE 'J'                                            
NEJ              W  1 A    VALUE 'N'                                            
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*      JOB INPUT                       *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
                                                                                
JOB INPUT (W11643D1 KEY (W11641-IDARTNR)                         +              
           W11643D2 KEY (CLAG-IDARTNR)                           +              
           W11643D3 KEY (SLAG-IDARTNR))                          +              
                                         START   A-INIT                         
                                                                                
                                                                                
IF MATCHED                                                                      
   PERFORM S23-CHECK-SLAG-IDDC                                                  
   IF FL-CDC EQ NEJ                                                             
      PERFORM S01-CALC-CDC-STOCK-BAL                                            
      FL-CDC  = JA                                                              
   END-IF                                                                       
   IF SLAG-IDDC EQ SDC LDC-EU                                                   
      PERFORM S05-CALC-DC-STOCK-BAL                                             
   END-IF                                                                       
   IF  (LAST-DUP W11643D3                                    +                  
   OR   NOT DUPLICATE   W11643D3 )                                              
      PERFORM S11-WRITE-OUTPUT                                                  
   END-IF                                                                       
ELSE                                                                            
   IF W11643D1 AND W11643D2                                                     
         PERFORM S01-CALC-CDC-STOCK-BAL                                         
         PERFORM S11-WRITE-OUTPUT                                               
   ELSE                                                                         
      IF W11643D1                                                               
         WS-STOCK-BALANCE  = 0                                                  
         WS-KVAKS-CDC      = 0                                                  
         WS-KVAKS-SDC      = 0                                                  
         PERFORM S11-WRITE-OUTPUT                                               
      END-IF                                                                    
   END-IF                                                                       
END-IF                                                                          
                                                                                
*                                                                               
A-INIT.  PROC                                                                   
      WS-STOCK-BALANCE = 0                                                      
      WS-KVAKS-CDC     = 0                                                      
      WS-KVAKS-SDC     = 0                                                      
      FL-CDC           = NEJ                                                    
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
S01-CALC-CDC-STOCK-BAL. PROC                                                    
                                                                                
      WS-STOCK-BALANCE = WS-STOCK-BALANCE                    +                  
                         + CLAG-KVLS                         +                  
                         + CLAG-KVAKS-PAV                    +                  
                         + CLAG-KVBEART                                         
*                                                                               
      WS-KVAKS-CDC     = WS-KVAKS-CDC                        +                  
                         + CLAG-KVAKS-CDC                                       
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
                                                                                
S05-CALC-DC-STOCK-BAL. PROC                                                     
                                                                                
      WS-STOCK-BALANCE = WS-STOCK-BALANCE                    +                  
                         + SLAG-KVLS                         +                  
                         + SLAG-KVAKS-PAV                    +                  
                         + SLAG-KVBEART                                         
*                                                                               
      WS-KVAKS-SDC     = WS-KVAKS-SDC                        +                  
                         + SLAG-KVAKS-SDC                                       
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
S11-WRITE-OUTPUT. PROC                                                          
                                                                                
   W11641A-IDARTNR     = W11641-IDARTNR                                         
   W11641A-KDERS       = W11641-KDERS                                           
   W11641A-FLERSATT    = W11641-FLERSATT                                        
   W11641A-KVTILLG-TOT = WS-STOCK-BALANCE                                       
   W11641A-KVAKS-CDC   = WS-KVAKS-CDC                                           
   W11641A-KVAKS-SDC   = WS-KVAKS-SDC                                           
   PUT W11643D4                                                                 
*                                                                               
*  INITIALIZE COUNTERS                                                          
*                                                                               
   WS-STOCK-BALANCE  = 0                                                        
   WS-KVAKS-CDC      = 0                                                        
   WS-KVAKS-SDC      = 0                                                        
   FL-CDC            = NEJ                                                      
*                                                                               
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
*                                                                               
*    --- S23-CHECK-SLAG-IDDC (MACRO PROCEDURE)                                  
%WWDC02 'SLAG-'                                                                 
*                                                                               
